OL,3,GNEWSAScot, 70, took 40 years to
OL,4,Across-stitch Bayeux Tapestry replica on
OL,5,Ahis daily commute
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe tapestry is almost 1,000 years old
OL,8,Fand tells the story of the events
OL,9,Fleading to the Norman invasion of
OL,10,FEngland in 1066 as well as the Battle
OL,11,Fof Hastings.
